{
  "name": "Cairo Morph",
  "slug": "cairomorph",
  "galleryOrder": 4234,
  "description": "A tiling that changes as it crosses the sheet: diamonds in one corner open into Cairo pentagons and then flatten into a basketweave of oblongs in the opposite corner.",
